efficient, optimized way to load wasm code.</div></span></div><ul class="namespaceItemContentSubItems"></ul></div></div><div id="namespace_webassembly_linkerror" class="namespaceItem" ><div class="docNodeKindIcon"><div class="text-Class bg-Class/15" title="Class">c</div></div><div class="namespaceItemContent"><a href="/api/web/wasm/#WebAssembly.LinkError" title="WebAssembly.LinkError">WebAssembly.LinkError</a><div class="namespaceItemContentDoc"><span><div data-color-mode="dark" data-light-theme="light" data-dark-theme="dark" class="markdown-body markdown-summary"><p>The <code>WebAssembly.LinkError</code> object indicates an error during module instantiation
